{"4718120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CLAM", "steam_appid": 4718120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/8b88f828898aa0f82e7abba139b1d3db.avif?t=1787725763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras_big/8b88f828898aa0f82e7abba139b1d3db.avif?t=1787725763 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚧 <strong>DEMO COMING SOON </strong>🚧  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU ARE CLAM, BE A RAT AND DO MORE RAT THINGS THAN EVER BEFORE. Clam the rat has escaped her rat mansion and has no way back in. RUN AND SQUEAK TO YOUR HEART'S CONTENT.  This quadrupedal diva has no idea where to go. What will Clam do? EAT YOGHURT, SNEEZE, SQUEAK. Don't let the rumble and ding of the no. 6 tram scare you away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squeak, stretch, run, surf sewers, master the rat car, spit peas, ruin the lives of the tenants and experience the joys of renting in an attempt to go back to the rat mansion.   Get ready for this story rich, 3D platformer absurdist comedy exploration good time jamboree. Sneak through kitschy spaces, climb onto kitchen counters, collect ladder pieces and thrilling accessories, converse with cockroaches and experience a classic Melbourne sharehouse riddled with black mold and amazing amenities.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/b3eb67be0e9cb93134ca2bf5175af598.avif?t=1787725763\" width=1014 height=227 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/c1b7f41892b42b5cc949284619bd87ea.avif?t=1787725763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras_big/c1b7f41892b42b5cc949284619bd87ea.avif?t=1787725763 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/ed77c479e77eb78bcdafb59b9dc80c9e.avif?t=1787725763\" width=927 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/c17880c61dc75d9ab85586af5aef08d4.avif?t=1787725763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras_big/c17880c61dc75d9ab85586af5aef08d4.avif?t=1787725763 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/8f73ded89ad4fa074317daeb4146fc2b.avif?t=1787725763\" width=975 height=201 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/ea967212acffa2cbfcc4f8c2deaf2eee.avif?t=1787725763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras_big/ea967212acffa2cbfcc4f8c2deaf2eee.avif?t=1787725763 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/9a291fbc0225df5602e027227966044c.avif?t=1787725763\" width=1075 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras/d88ebb52e951359f0e27793ad2d17c73.avif?t=1787725763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4718120/extras_big/d88ebb52e951359f0e27793ad2d17c73.avif?t=1787725763 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_gam